## The clinical-label axis

`clinical_labels.json`. {{clinical_virus}} / {{clinical_disease}},
{{clinical_trials}} `IN_TRIAL_FOR` and {{clinical_treats}} `TREATS` edges,
family {{clinical_family}}, alpha {{clinical_alpha}}.

| scorer | AUC | corrected interval | verdict |
|:---|---:|:---|:---|
| max Tanimoto, symmetric k=10 | {{clinical_structure_auc}} | {{clinical_structure_ci}} | clears **{{clinical_structure_dir}}** chance |
| degree | {{clinical_degree_auc}} | {{clinical_degree_ci}} | clears above chance |

Degree at or above structure: **{{clinical_degree_wins}}**. What predicts
whether a compound reached a trial is how well studied it is. This is the one
independent label axis in the repository and it does not support the
structure scorer.

{{clinical_pop_table}}

